TITLE User question simulation
SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH 7 charge
    Ca 50 mmol/kgw
    water 0.001
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 10
    Gypsum 0 10
    Aragonite 0 10
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 1
    -temperature 25
    CO2(g) 1
    CH4(g) 5
    H2S(g) 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected5.txt
    -reset false
    -pH true
END
